#: data/maps/Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse/scripts.inc:286
msgctxt "Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse_Text_Greeting"
msgid ""
"I'm the DIVING TREASURE HUNTER!\p"
"I'm the awesome dude who makes\n"
"deep-sea dives to gather treasures\l"
"resting at the bottom.$"
msgstr ""
"我就是潜水寻宝猎人！\p"
"我就是那个潜入深海，\n"
"收集沉睡在海底的宝物的\l"
"超酷的家伙。$"

#: data/maps/Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse/scripts.inc:292
msgctxt "Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse_Text_HaveYouSeenAnyShards"
msgid ""
"Tell me, have you seen any SHARDS of\n"
"tools made in ancient times?$"
msgstr ""
"告诉我，你有没有见过\n"
"古代工具的碎片？$"

#: data/maps/Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse/scripts.inc:296
msgctxt "Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse_Text_YouHaventGotAnyShards"
msgid ""
"You haven't got any treasures\n"
"for me…\p"
"If you see any SHARDS, like the RED\n"
"SHARD, you've got to trade it with me!$"
msgstr ""
"你没有我想要的宝物啊……\p"
"如果你找到了红色碎片之类的碎片，\n"
"一定要和我交换哦！$"

#: data/maps/Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse/scripts.inc:302
msgctxt "Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse_Text_ThatsAShardIllTradeYou"
msgid ""
"Oh, hey! That…\n"
"That's a SHARD! I'm looking for those!\p"
"Oh, man, you've got to trade that\n"
"with me! I'll give you something good!$"
msgstr ""
"哦，嘿！那个……\n"
"那是碎片！我正在找它！\p"
"哎呀，你一定要和我交换！\n"
"我会给你好东西的！$"

#: data/maps/Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse/scripts.inc:308
msgctxt "Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse_Text_WhatDoYouWantToTrade"
msgid "What do you want to trade?$"
msgstr "你想交换什么？$"

#: data/maps/Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse/scripts.inc:311
msgctxt "Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse_Text_YoullTradeShardForStone"
msgid ""
"You'll trade your {STR_VAR_1} for\n"
"my {STR_VAR_2}, then?$"
msgstr ""
"那么，你要用你的{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"交换我的{STR_VAR_2}吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse/scripts.inc:315
msgctxt "Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse_Text_ItsADeal"
msgid ""
"It's a done deal!\n"
"Use that wisely!$"
msgstr ""
"成交！\n"
"好好利用它吧！$"

#: data/maps/Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse/scripts.inc:319
msgctxt "Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse_Text_TradeSomethingElse"
msgid "Do you want to trade something else?$"
msgstr "你还想交换别的东西吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse/scripts.inc:322
msgctxt "Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse_Text_BagFull"
msgid ""
"Whoops, your BAG's full.\n"
"Get rid of some items, friend!$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，你的包包满了。\n"
"朋友，先清理一些道具吧！$"

#: data/maps/Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse/scripts.inc:326
msgctxt "Route124_DivingTreasureHuntersHouse_Text_ComeBackIfYouChangeMind"
msgid ""
"No? That's a downer.\n"
"Well, if you change your mind, come back.$"
msgstr ""
"不换吗？真扫兴。\n"
"好吧，如果你改变主意了就再来吧。$"

